Package: ImageFilteR
Title: Image filtering and RGB color manipulation
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Philipp", "Valina Allo", , "philipp.valina.allo@ki.se", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An image filtering package allowing users to load images, convert them into a grayscale image, apply red, green and blue color filters and use threshold based filtering as well as save the resulting images.
